$DATUM 3-(tert-Butyl-dimethyl-silanyloxy)-1-formyl-7-aza-bicyclo[2.2.1]heptane-7-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (33) .To a solution of oxalyl chloride (430 μL,
5.014 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (40 mL) was added DMSO (470 μL, 6.617 mmol) at-78
°C. The reaction mixture was stirred for 20 min and a solution of 32
(1.184 g, 3.311 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (60 mL) was added at -78 °C. The reaction
mixture was stirred for 40 min at -78 °C, and then Et3N (1.9 mL, 13.52
mmol) was added. The solution was allowed to warm to rt. After 1 h
stirring at rt, the reaction mixture was quenched by the addition of
water. The mixture was extracted with CH2Cl2 (80 mL×3). The combined
organic phase was washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and the solvent
was evaporated. Column chromatography (n-hexane / AcOEt = 3 / 1) gave
compound 33 (1.156 g, 98%) as a colorless solid. This compound was used
in the next step without further purification. 1H-NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3):
9.930 (1H, d, J= 31.92 Hz,-CHO), 4.137 (1H, d, J= 38.96 Hz, H-C(1)),
3.983 (1H, d, J= 6.12 Hz, H-C(2)), 1.995-1.829 (4H, m), 1.444-1.344 (2H,
m)[CH2 ×3], 1.422 (9H ,s,-O-C(CH3)3), 0.879 (9H, s,- Si-C(CH3)3), 0.077
(3H, s), 0.054 (3H, s),[-Si-(CH3)2]. HRMS (ESI,[M+Na]+): Calcd. for
C18H33NNaO4Si, 378.2077. Found: 378.2071.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Swern oxidation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Water-Stable Helical Structure of Tertiary Amides of Bicyclic β-Amino
Acid Bearing 7-Azabicyclo[2.2.1]heptane. Full Control of Amide Cis-Trans
Equilibrium by Bridgehead Substitution
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
