$DATUM 1-Acetyl-3-(tert-butyl-dimethyl-silanyloxy)-7-aza-bicyclo[2.2.1]heptane-7-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (37). To a solution of oxalyl chloride (140 μL,
1.632 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (20 mL) was added DMSO (155 μL, 2.182 mmol) at-78
°C. The reaction mixture was stirred for 20 min and a solution of 36
(406.1 mg, 1.093 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (30 mL) was added at -78 °C. The
reaction mixture was stirred for 40 min at -78 °C, and then Et3N (615 μL,
4.376 mmol) was added. The solution was allowed to warm to rt. After 1 h
stirring, the reaction mixture was quenched by the addition of water. The
mixture was extracted with CH2Cl2 (40 mL×3). The combined organic phase
was washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and the solvent was evaporated.
Column chromatography (n-hexane / AcOEt = 4 / 1) gave compound 37 (380.2
mg, 94%) as a colorless oil. . 1H-NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): 4.144 (1H, bs,
H-C(1)), 3.976-3.954 (1H, m, H-C(2)), 2.312 (3H, s,-COCH3), 2.042-1.983
(1H, m), 1.891-1.859 (3H,m), 1.344-1.179 (2H, m)[CH2 ×3], 1.416 (9H
,s,-O-C(CH3)3), 0.880 (9H, s,- Si-C(CH3)3), 0.072 (3H, s), 0.047 (3H,
s),[-Si-(CH3)2]. HRMS (ESI,[M+Na]+ ): Calcd. for C19H35NNaO4Si, 392.2233.
Found: 392.2242.
