$DATUM 3-Oxo-7-aza-bicyclo[2.2.1]heptane-1,7-dicarboxylic acid 7-tert-butyl
ester 1-methyl ester (19) (Scheme 2) . The alcohol 18 was synthesized in
a similar manner previously described in literatures (ref 22). To a
solution of oxalyl chloride (2.4 mL, 28.22 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (170 mL) was
added DMSO (3.0 mL, 42.52 mmol) at -78 °C. The reaction mixture was
stirred for 20 min and a solution of 18 (5.024 g, 18.52 mmol) in CH2Cl2
(250 mL) was added to this solution at -78 °C. The reaction mixture was
stirred for 40 min at -78 °C, and then Et3N (12.0 mL, 85.38 mmol) was
added. The solution was allowed to warm to rt. After stirring for 1 hr,
the reaction mixture was quenched by the addition of water. The whole was
extracted with CH2Cl2 (200 mL×3). The combined organic phase was washed
with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and the solvent was evaporated. Column
chromatography (n-hexane / AcOEt = 7 / 3) gave compound 19 (4.448 g, 89%)
as a colorless oil. 1H-NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): 4.347 (1H, d, J= 5.6 Hz,
H-C(4)), 3.841 (3H, s, COOCH3), 2.852 (1H, d,d, J= 17.68, 2.80 Hz),
2.401-2.285 (2H, m), 2.194-2.125 (1H, m), 1.910-1.845 (1H, m),
1.698-1.632 (1H, m) (CH2 ×3), 1.413 (9H, s, -C(CH3)3). 13C-NMR (100MHz,
CDCl3): 207.11, 169.22, 155.45, 82.14, 68.39, 66.96, 52.51, 47.10, 31.75,
27.92, 23.67. HRMS (ESI,[M+Na]+): Calcd. for C13H19NNaO5, 292.1161.
Found: 292.1126.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Swern oxidation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
