Alkanes with Quaternary Carbons Isolated from Diverse Geological Sources
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Crich, David; Xu, Huadong; Kenig, Fabien
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2006), 71(13), 5016-5019

